n class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/1ed0c516cab6fbea3bc5ca816678352a.avif?t=1778346907\" width=560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/4e1b3e3b41e28ada6032fef2f5481938.poster.avif?t=1778346907\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/4e1b3e3b41e28ada6032fef2f5481938.webm?t=1778346907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/4e1b3e3b41e28ada6032fef2f5481938.mp4?t=1778346907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized stages as you travel deeper underground through the procedurally generated tunnels: icy caverns, glowing mushroom groves, volcanic chambers, and more. On the way, you will meet the cave’s inhabitants - cute but annoying animals who will try to get in your way. Watch out, there's snakes on the ceiling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/3b0659f959fd529f671923544379ed6a.avif?t=1778346907\" width=560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/a9c963d44f95006e681034c4a8989146.poster.avif?t=1778346907\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/a9c963d44f95006e681034c4a8989146.webm?t=1778346907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/a9c963d44f95006e681034c4a8989146.mp4?t=1778346907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gold you've mined to unlock nodes in a massive upgrade tree filled with new perks, different guns, gun cosmetics, and permanent upgrades. Experiment, refine your playstyle, and unlock deeper layers of the cave, its systems are waiting to be mastered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Descend into a crystal filled cave in this roguelike rail shooter. Smash ammo gems to mine more ammo, destroy traps, gather EXP, and adapt your strategy with game changing perks, but run out of ammo, and it’s all over…", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/bbd1ec36e82d796d74860d42cf29baeaa33028bb/header.jpg?t=1778346907", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/f0b315fccbe420e3778fd7380f013508fea44d79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778346907", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/f0b315fccbe420e3778fd7380f013508fea44d79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778346907", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:<